katex 0.18.1 — https://registry.npmjs.org/katex/-/katex-0.18.1.tgz

Vendored, not npm-installed: the frontend has no build step and no bundler, so
`public/` is served as-is by express.static and the browser loads these files
directly. Copied verbatim from the package's `dist/`:

  katex.min.js
  katex.min.css   (unmodified — do not hand-edit, so updates stay a plain copy)
  fonts/*.woff2   (woff2 ONLY; the woff/ttf siblings are deliberately omitted)

Dropping the woff/ttf fonts takes this directory from ~1.1 MB to ~590 KB. It is
safe because every `src:` list in katex.min.css names woff2 first, so a browser
that supports woff2 never requests the fallbacks — and one that doesn't cannot
run this app anyway.

To update: `npm pack katex`, untar, and re-copy the four items above.
